<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-LYON GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LYON GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $750,000 Lyon men's tennis</p>
<p>Grand Prix on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):     </p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>5-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Gianluca Pozzi (Italy) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>4-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Petr Korda (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>First round: </p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Chris Woodruff (U.S.) beat 1-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-3 6-3  </p>
<p>Second round: </p>
<p>Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat 8-Michael Stich (Germany) 6-3</p>
<p>6-7 (9-11) 6-2.</p>
</text>
